[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

[sub_resource type="RectangleShape2D" id="Shape_1"]

; The variable is the editor marker of the three 2D joints, at the default and a long
; `length` and `initial_offset`, and on a rotated and a scaled node. The golden turns the Gizmos toggle
; on. No other golden has a 2D joint with it on, so none shows a regression in the marker.
; Godot draws the markers in a game only with collision debugging. Measure them with
; `pnpm ref:godot --mode 2d --debug-collisions`, the mode the golden captures with.
; The two bodies sit far off screen, so the debug collision shapes stay out of the frame. Every value is in range.

